     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">What’s your exact code? Are you using write.csv() or something else (perhaps write_csv() from readr)? I have no problems with this:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(lavaan)\r\nHS.model &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39; visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3\r\n              textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6\r\n              speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9 &#39;</span>\r\nfit &lt;- cfa(HS.model, data=HolzingerSwineford1939)\r\nhead(predict(fit)); tail(predict(fit))\r\nwrite.csv(predict(fit), <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;~/Desktop/fit.csv&quot;</span>, row.names = <span>FALSE</span>)\r\nread.fit &lt;- read.csv(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;~/Desktop/fit.csv&quot;</span>)\r\nhead(read.fit); tail(read.fit)\r\nall.equal(read.fit[,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>], predict(fit)[,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>])\r\nall.equal(read.fit[,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">2</span>], predict(fit)[,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">2</span>])\r\nall.equal(read.fit[,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">3</span>], predict(fit)[,<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">3</span>])\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5XaGF0J3MgeW91ciBleGFjdCBjb2RlPyBBcmUgeW91IHVzaW5nIHdyaXRlLmNzdigpIG9y\r\nIHNvbWV0aGluZyBlbHNlIChwZXJoYXBzIHdyaXRlX2NzdigpIGZyb20gcmVhZHIpPyBJIGhhdmUg\r\nbm8gcHJvYmxlbXMgd2l0aCB0aGlzOjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+YGBgcjwvZGl2\r\nPjxkaXY+bGlicmFyeShsYXZhYW4pPGJyPkhTLm1vZGVsICZsdDstICcgdmlzdWFsICZuYnNwOz1+\r\nIHgxICsgeDIgKyB4Mzxicj4mbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNw\r\nOyAmbmJzcDsgdGV4dHVhbCA9fiB4NCArIHg1ICsgeDY8YnI+Jm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsg\r\nJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7IHNwZWVkICZuYnNwOyA9fiB4NyArIHg4ICsgeDkg\r\nJzxicj5maXQgJmx0Oy0gY2ZhKEhTLm1vZGVsLCBkYXRhPUhvbHppbmdlclN3aW5lZm9yZDE5Mzkp\r\nPGJyPmhlYWQocHJlZGljdChmaXQpKTsgdGFpbChwcmVkaWN0KGZpdCkpPGJyPndyaXRlLmNzdihw\r\ncmVkaWN0KGZpdCksICJ+L0Rlc2t0b3AvZml0LmNzdiIsIHJvdy5uYW1lcyA9IEZBTFNFKTxicj5y\r\nZWFkLmZpdCAmbHQ7LSByZWFkLmNzdigifi9EZXNrdG9wL2ZpdC5jc3YiKTxicj5oZWFkKHJlYWQu\r\nZml0KTsgdGFpbChyZWFkLmZpdCk8YnI+YWxsLmVxdWFsKHJlYWQuZml0WywxXSwgcHJlZGljdChm\r\naXQpWywxXSk8YnI+YWxsLmVxdWFsKHJlYWQuZml0WywyXSwgcHJlZGljdChmaXQpWywyXSk8YnI+\r\nYWxsLmVxdWFsKHJlYWQuZml0WywzXSwgcHJlZGljdChmaXQpWywzXSk8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PmBgYDxi\r\ncj48L2Rpdj4=\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\"></div></div></div><br></blockquote></div>"
